"profileLocationPlatformId":null,"profileLocationCompleteAddress":null,"profileLocationLatitude":null,"profileLocationLongitude":null,"transcript":"What is the resting rich face? Let's get into the starter pack. And it all begins with the L'Oreal Paris Serum Le Duo. Because we all know hydrated skin is a starting point of a good day. With collagen peptides that help combat wrinkles and improve firmness, while vitamins B3 and C give a radiant, glowy finish. Next is gonna be a sharp brow. This always makes me feel super polished. And once the outfit is on, we cannot forget a signature 90s lip. And finally, we can't forget a signature sunglass. I mean, it's summertime, so I can't go anywhere without them. And this is my resting rich face. Thank you L'Oreal for sponsoring this video.","transcriptLanguage":"en","transcriptChunks":[{"startSeconds":0.13,"endSeconds":1.79,"text":"What is the resting rich face?"},{"startSeconds":1.79,"endSeconds":2.99,"text":"Let's get into the starter pack."},{"startSeconds":2.99,"endSeconds":6.17,"text":"And it all begins with the L'Oreal Paris Serum Le Duo."},{"startSeconds":6.17,"endSeconds":7.43,"text":"Because we all know hydrated skin"},{"startSeconds":7.43,"endSeconds":8.91,"text":"is a starting point of a good day."},{"startSeconds":8.91,"endSeconds":10.97,"text":"With collagen peptides that help combat wrinkles"},{"startSeconds":10.97,"endSeconds":11.89,"text":"and improve firmness,"},{"startSeconds":11.89,"endSeconds":14.73,"text":"while vitamins B3 and C give a radiant, glowy finish."},{"startSeconds":14.73,"endSeconds":15.99,"text":"Next is gonna be a sharp brow."},{"startSeconds":15.99,"endSeconds":17.99,"text":"This always makes me feel super polished."},{"startSeconds":17.99,"endSeconds":18.95,"text":"And once the outfit is on,"},{"startSeconds":18.95,"endSeconds":21.49,"text":"we cannot forget a signature 90s lip."},{"startSeconds":21.49,"endSeconds":23.89,"text":"And finally, we can't forget a signature sunglass."},{"startSeconds":23.89,"endSeconds":25.01,"text":"I mean, it's summertime,"},{"startSeconds":25.01,"endSeconds":26.75,"text":"so I can't go anywhere without them."},{"startSeconds":26.75,"endSeconds":28.33,"text":"And this is my resting rich face."},{"startSeconds":28.33,"endSeconds":30.33,"text":"Thank you L'Oreal for sponsoring this video."}],"frames":[{"id":"med_ecf1d001edc0046f3df5129d8d19","position":1,"timestampSeconds":2.6,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tiktok/7659587914040495374/1_2.60.webp"},{"id":"med_2ba907d2c6ec5a846ce2e0f1fd31","position":2,"timestampSeconds":3.5,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tiktok/7659587914040495374/2_3.50.webp"},{"id":"med_2cb1bb3c424100aab17d6e359fab","position":3,"timestampSeconds":4.57,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tiktok/7659587914040495374/3_4.57.webp"},{"id":"med_5ecbac5ee46b1073f8f99ef2c469","position":4,"timestampSeconds":5.7,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tiktok/7659587914040495374/4_5.70.webp"},{"id":"med_4340abe655fa59d004cdf2a67138","position":5,"timestampSeconds":5.73,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tiktok/7659587914040495374/5_5.73.webp"},{"id":"med_9c7195b54713a16c5f6df1f276e9","position":6,"timestampSeconds":6.47,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tiktok/7659587914040495374/6_6.47.webp"},{"id":"med_852507fab8dbfc365af55be26d1b","position":7,"timestampSeconds":7.5,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tiktok/7659587914040495374/7_7.50.webp"},{"id":"med_9a26406c7637dff6ccda3f6b6564","position":8,"timestampSeconds":8.63,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tiktok/7659587914040495374/8_8.63.webp"},{"id":"med_0da338527da218f31883253e7a9a","position":9,"timestampSeconds":12.53,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tiktok/7659587914040495374/9_12.53.webp"},{"id":"med_c1882ef8b7104cf512886d9e593b","position":10,"timestampSeconds":13.5,